        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='min-height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;container-type:inline-size;background:#ffffff;font-family:Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#0f172a'><div style='box-sizing:border-box;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px clamp(20px,5cqw,40px) 64px'><div style='padding:10px 0;border-top:3px solid #0f172a;border-bottom:1px solid #0f172a;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6d28d9'>Template</div><header style='padding:40px 0 32px'><h1 style='margin:0;font:500 clamp(40px,9.5cqw,72px)/.98 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.025em;text-wrap:balance;color:#0f172a'>Node Template</h1><p style='margin:18px 0 0;max-width:36ch;font:italic 400 clamp(20px,3.6cqw,26px)/1.35 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#475569'>The smallest graph that presents itself properly. Copy it, then replace these words with your own.</p></header><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;flex-direction:row-reverse;align-items:flex-start;gap:32px 40px'><aside style='flex:1 1 220px;min-width:0;padding-top:10px;border-top:3px solid #0f172a'><h2 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f172a'>The parts</h2><div style='padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1'><div style='font:600 14px/20px system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Declaration</div><div style='font:400 13px/19px system-ui;color:#475569'>Who the graph is: its name, description and kind.</div></div><div style='padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1'><div style='font:600 14px/20px system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Detail view</div><div style='font:400 13px/19px system-ui;color:#475569'>The full card, shown when there is room.</div></div><div style='padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1'><div style='font:600 14px/20px system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Summary view</div><div style='font:400 13px/19px system-ui;color:#475569'>The short card, for a list or a crowded workspace.</div></div><div style='padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1'><div style='font:600 14px/20px system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Icon view</div><div style='font:400 13px/19px system-ui;color:#475569'>The tile, when the graph is small on screen.</div></div><div style='padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1'><div style='font:600 14px/20px system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Glyph</div><div style='font:400 13px/19px system-ui;color:#475569'>The symbol, when nothing else fits.</div></div><div style='padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1'><div style='font:600 14px/20px system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Landing content</div><div style='font:400 13px/19px system-ui;color:#475569'>This page.</div></div></aside><div style='flex:999 1 380px;min-width:0'><section><h2 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6d28d9'>What you are looking at</h2><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#1e293b'><span style='float:left;padding:6px 10px 0 0;font:500 68px/54px Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#0f172a'>T</span>his page is the landing content: what someone sees first when they open the graph. It is a Content node, so it is the one part of this graph that shows while browsing.</p><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#1e293b'>Everything else is how the graph looks from outside. The Declaration draws one Surface: a Detail view, then a Summary, then an Icon, ending in a Glyph. The workspace shows whichever fits the room the graph is given.</p></section></div></div><figure style='margin:44px 0 0'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 680 232' style='display:block;width:100%;height:auto' role='img' aria-label='The Declaration draws a Surface through the Detail, Summary and Icon views to the Glyph, and a landing surface to the landing content'><rect width='680' height='232' rx='6' fill='#f1f5f9'/><path d='M150 72 H178' fill='none' stroke='#6d28d9' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M186 72 L176 67 L176 77 Z' fill='#6d28d9'/><path d='M296 72 H316' fill='none' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M324 72 L314 67 L314 77 Z' fill='#64748b'/><path d='M416 72 H436' fill='none' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M444 72 L434 67 L434 77 Z' fill='#64748b'/><path d='M516 72 H544' fill='none' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M552 72 L542 67 L542 77 Z' fill='#64748b'/><path d='M90 104 V168 H178' fill='none' stroke='#6d28d9' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M186 168 L176 163 L176 173 Z' fill='#6d28d9'/><rect x='30' y='40' width='120' height='64' rx='10' fill='#0f172a'/><text x='90' y='77' text-anchor='middle' fill='#f8fafc' font-family='system-ui' font-size='14' font-weight='700'>Declaration</text><rect x='186' y='34' width='110' height='76' rx='10' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#cbd5e1'/><text x='241' y='77' text-anchor='middle' fill='#0f172a' font-family='system-ui' font-size='14' font-weight='600'>Detail</text><rect x='324' y='44' width='92' height='56' rx='10' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#cbd5e1'/><text x='370' y='77' text-anchor='middle' fill='#0f172a' font-family='system-ui' font-size='14' font-weight='600'>Summary</text><rect x='444' y='52' width='72' height='40' rx='10' fill='#ede9fe' stroke='#c4b5fd'/><text x='480' y='77' text-anchor='middle' fill='#0f172a' font-family='system-ui' font-size='14' font-weight='600'>Icon</text><circle cx='578' cy='72' r='26' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#cbd5e1'/><text x='578' y='77' text-anchor='middle' fill='#0f172a' font-family='system-ui' font-size='13' font-weight='600'>Glyph</text><rect x='186' y='140' width='230' height='56' rx='10' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#cbd5e1'/><text x='301' y='173' text-anchor='middle' fill='#0f172a' font-family='system-ui' font-size='14' font-weight='600'>Landing content</text><text x='168' y='60' text-anchor='middle' fill='#6d28d9' font-family='system-ui' font-size='11' font-weight='700'>surface</text><text x='100' y='186' fill='#6d28d9' font-family='system-ui' font-size='11' font-weight='700'>landing surface</text></svg><figcaption style='margin-top:10px;font:400 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#475569'><b style='color:#0f172a'>Fig. 1</b> &nbsp;How this graph is wired. The views step down in size from left to right, and the chain ends in the Glyph.</figcaption></figure><section style='margin-top:48px;padding-top:32px;border-top:1px solid #0f172a'><h2 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6d28d9'>Make it yours</h2><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#1e293b'>Name the graph and describe it on the Declaration. Rewrite this page so it says what the graph holds. Then rewrite the three views so each one says, at its own size, what the graph is.</p></section></div></div>"
        },
